      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "外ニ破隊附屬銃手　四隊一隊三十人"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "ほかに はたいふぞくじゅうしゅ よんたい いったいさんじゅうにん"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "In addition: riflemen attached to the 破隊 — 4 units, 30 men per unit. The page clearly prints 破 (石 + 皮), not 砲. The same domain's entry in the volume-2 officials-and-military table also prints 大破隊, and two columns to the right this page prints 大砲隊 四隊 with the same count of four, so these 破隊 are almost certainly the four artillery units written with a variant character."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "破隊附属銃手（大泉藩分）"
      }
